[{"title":"昌甫有诗学长句次韵以柬处晦且当应举","author":"韩淲","text":"章泉老子之诗学，笔自峥嵘心自泊。\n暮春静把一杯看，纵有世情无处著。\n三传且莫束高阁，待子龙津名一跃。\n收回旧话再商量，沈谢应刘都扫却。\n蚕叶人家采摘忙，麦将秋矣水浮秧。\n平田冷漠吹朝雨，侧径深微过夕阳。\n残酒馀香愁梦枕，断篇遗简苦吟囊。\n莺啼燕语春归也，不道高斋口自芳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25843,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"斯远访昌甫同作音字诗因又一首","author":"韩淲","text":"故人湖海谁知音，章泉病翁卧山林。\n我思不见夜长寂，君往与同秋正阴。\n修筠乱石一径静，风雨满窗清且深。\n安得相从日上下，骚雅共倾陶写心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25844,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵吴推官二首 其一","author":"韩淲","text":"紫菊红萸仍酒美，万里秋云接天水。\n登高能赋我何堪，会逢其适聊尔耳。\n苍山小亭看弈棋，不有此客无此诗。\n古往今来吹破帽，河梁归路月明知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25845,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵吴推官二首 其二","author":"韩淲","text":"坡云今日我重九，自古骚人无此手。\n一从陶令归去来，谁有閒中能漉酒。\n篱边采采黄花歌，不盈襟袖还几多。\n满城风雨固应尔，欲制颓龄如老何。\n怪来清气侵毛发，忽得新篇有风骨。\n溪亭应记见南山，玉水波寒步微月。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25846,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读东溪可正平诗","author":"韩淲","text":"冰霜落涧岁云暮，寂寂远岫松风回。\n村深古寺作钟磬，车马路断樵者来。\n参差一抹起宿雁，清浅数枝横小梅。\n日昃翠寒云屋迥，竹炉煨火尽馀杯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25847,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"陈君举舍人集新刊三山因读其诗有感","author":"韩淲","text":"陈止斋诗不草草，约貌前头诸旧老。\n大章短句可思议，妙意馀情愁绝倒。\n生姜门有水心道，赤水亭占龙窟好。\n伯牙无弦骥伏皂，摹拓剩残人或葆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25848,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吴判官野阁诗述先公甚勤次韵谢之","author":"韩淲","text":"我登野阁思过庭，吻角欲语徒悲鸣。\n丽谯西池水木秀，当年手种年年生。\n五六十春几交印，幕画英游应接轫。\n由来感旧谁发挥，龙光斗牛知令问。\n诗来唤醒醉梦中，一日好事传江东。\n吴公治行天下美，隐然盖本西汉风。\n大抵轩窗数间屋，雅俗升沈堪踯躅。\n光前绝后得名章，便觉流芳争诵读。\n夕阳淡月色朦胧，想公退食书自工。\n黄卷之间欠伸处，催煎茶椀呼家童。\n妙声直启重玄钥，惠徼先君宁苟作。\n其孤衰微但下拜，犹向霜天辱杯酌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25849,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"录王昌龄诗","author":"韩淲","text":"千古万古琉璃堂，中有一人万丈光。\n长篇短篇任摸索，小句大句宜忖量。\n风花雪月初非远，城郭山林各是忙。\n惆怅无因见范蠡，空留佳话说南唐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25850,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题紫溪春晚图画","author":"韩淲","text":"东风满地吹瑶草，水煖双流山四抱。\n参差楼观倚晴空，林霭乍收初日杲。\n杏桃婀娜开花早，蝶绕莺迁鱼在藻。\n人家篱落动耕桑，溪女往来翁唤媪。\n务头腊酒贱仍好，麦熟官清农晏保。\n岝崿峰高多醉游，天目潭深无旱祷。\n谁把丹青能一扫，点缀毫芒殊可考。\n分明融荡紫溪春，路入烟霞是仙岛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25851,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶成","author":"韩淲","text":"蛮歌俚耳吾不愁，江南五月疑凉秋。\n渐离荆卿易水流，图穷匕首非霸谋。\n吴头楚尾龙虎幽，击筑乃尔听市讴，调苦节促如远游。\n安得酒船同拍浮，衮衮切切终悠悠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25852,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂赋二首","author":"韩淲","text":"今年腊尽春风起，凌晓撑船度溪水。\n去年九日菊花开，相与周游二三子。\n山深泉井一乡村，地僻章丘数家市。\n酒饮诗成可奈何，坐想斯人消吝鄙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25853,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠天台郑道士","author":"韩淲","text":"霞杯为奏阮咸曲，怅望十年湖水烟。\n闻过东嘉看雁荡，野云留宿话翛然。\n谭诗忽见蒋云出，今去洞庭衡岳前。\n能说鍊师神不老，识全元是赤城仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25854,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"慈福太后生辰圣驾同中宫过北内上寿至晓銮仗方回观者无不仰赞庆礼四朝之尊也","author":"韩淲","text":"盛典行长乐，秋光溢寿樽。\n后仪崇太姒，帝服见曾孙。\n遥想重闱集，咸推六殿恩。\n欢声开九秩，诞节照乾坤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25855,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日","author":"韩淲","text":"院落无人到，游丝自短长。\n细风添霁色，斜日转流光。\n柳入莺边嫩，花飞燕外香。\n一杯春昼永，试与问年芳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25856,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵元夕 其一","author":"韩淲","text":"烟月收微霭，春归柳色深。\n落梅还满眼，啼鸟独惊心。\n醉熟醒何益，愁多梦亦侵。\n银花元夜句，犹记昔人吟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25857,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵元夕 其二","author":"韩淲","text":"辇路元宵盛，楼台烟火深。\n异乡今日意，乐事去年心。\n溪阔斜阳下，林空细雨侵。\n扶舆且萧散，寻胜一閒吟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25858,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"人日","author":"韩淲","text":"去年苦无雪，今雨又多风。\n人日平头过，元宵转眼中。\n野梅香更白，文杏色微红。\n篱落春阴外，楼台晓雾空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25859,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"正月十一日","author":"韩淲","text":"春前三日雪，今则倏霜晴。\n涧谷冰凘满，溪山风物清。\n梅梢已飘洒，兰穗始敷荣。\n宿约多神赛，君来酒重倾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25860,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三月一日","author":"韩淲","text":"海棠花上雪，憔悴却如人。\n晓觉春光淡，时占天气新。\n燕脂才糁糁，翡翠正匀匀。\n睡足寒犹力，宜多酒入唇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25861,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨中上巳","author":"韩淲","text":"风作连宵雨，山寒复昼冥。\n酴醾花白白，杨柳叶青青。\n令节空轻过，芳时惜易经。\n清真王逸少，修禊写兰亭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25862,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵昌甫寒食","author":"韩淲","text":"南北已分垄，后来那得知。\n侵寻空岁月，流落漫歌诗。\n宿草露殊湿，白杨风更悲。\n江村暗寒食，老大故园思。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25863,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十四日 其一","author":"韩淲","text":"淡淡春晴晚，窗前燕子飞。\n酒杯谁共饮，诗笔自孤挥。\n上冢家山远，下湖仙苑稀。\n空多冶游者，扶醉赶门归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25864,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十四日 其二","author":"韩淲","text":"风花郭店路，灵井隔云溪。\n渡水鱼争出，随山莺乱啼。\n只疑身未老，不信梦还迷。\n今日逢寒食，西湖春草萋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25865,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"二十五日","author":"韩淲","text":"山径濒溪转，林亭亚谷斜。\n老诗无住著，健酒有须赊。\n急雨催杨柳，微阴养杏花。\n重帘新燕子，随处觅生涯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25866,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚春","author":"韩淲","text":"细雨收微暖，轻云起薄阴。\n舟横莲叶浅，人度柳花深。\n佛屋多支径，旂亭亦远林。\n一春思放浪，尽日喜登临。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25867,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"初七日","author":"韩淲","text":"晚来台上坐，犹自说春归。\n可惜园林里，都无花片飞。\n榜人劳载酒，鸥鸟定忘机。\n笑摘青梅子，停杯看雨肥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25868,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七月","author":"韩淲","text":"水石云山里，归来已九秋。\n隔城如浅近，邻寺始深幽。\n慧远逢修静，文渊说少游。\n径荒殊不扫，风叶上牵牛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25869,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日","author":"韩淲","text":"客里逢重九，路经鹅岭头。\n物华元自好，意绪不禁愁。\n霜重晓犹积，烟低寒不收。\n营营本何事，吹笛下沧洲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25870,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赵运干秩满经由寄怀任舍人直院九日","author":"韩淲","text":"季月黄花酒，今还过玉溪。\n野僧谈众妙，林叟祇孤暌。\n滕阁有前境，胥山无别蹊。\n会须直学士，霄汉记閒栖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25871,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十一月晦","author":"韩淲","text":"沙雁徒高下，荒鸡任喔咿。\n连山云日过，夹涧雪霜吹。\n叶径湿仍滑，柴扉久易攲。\n不知诗在否，诗亦费心思。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25872,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十二月旦","author":"韩淲","text":"雪后寒檐滴，青灯夜看诗。\n人情虽已甚，物色又何其。\n永永孤城漏，垂垂老境时。\n琉璃剪木叶，今岁是冰枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25873,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岁晚","author":"韩淲","text":"岁晚家何在，冰溪怀玉山。\n雪梅香汎汎，霜树色斑斑。\n村酒相招唤，田歌自往还。\n白头搔更懒，今识市朝间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25874,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十六日 其一","author":"韩淲","text":"不恨常疏隔，何疑欠讨论。\n同心惟设饭，尽兴亦空樽。\n日与樵争席，时看子候门。\n山场风莽广，溪港雨沉昏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25875,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十六日 其二","author":"韩淲","text":"寒水浮沙急，昏烟拥树深。\n茅茨得幽隐，藜杖失荒寻。\n地暖疏梅发，篱虚败叶侵。\n终风惊达夜，未雪苦多阴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25876,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"窗日","author":"韩淲","text":"饭已南窗暖，依违睡思生。\n息虚神即固，气定体殊轻。\n霜熟日初上，檐疏纸透明。\n欠伸询早暮，一唱午鸡声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25877,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乍暖","author":"韩淲","text":"乍暖人多困，昼长春已深。\n残花红糁糁，新叶绿阴阴。\n山寺依岩曲，湖船过水心。\n钩帘醒午睡，閒觉去来吟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25878,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚晴","author":"韩淲","text":"雨阔云难敛，高楼忽晚晴。\n地卑虽带润，天近自增明。\n蚊动初成势，鸦翻过宿声。\n墙根有孤树，清坐见凉生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25879,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乍冷洒然","author":"韩淲","text":"不可更禁当，伏阴多夏凉。\n体中时作恶，鼻观日焚香。\n照眼惊双鬓，支颐待一觞。\n诗来相劳苦，边事敢筹量。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25880,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"初十日","author":"韩淲","text":"沉沉三日雨，衮衮四山风。\n潢潦从浮汎，群阴漫长雄。\n深居何藉屐，矮屋且遮篷。\n急敛身心住，徐看鼻息通。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25881,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"二十一日","author":"韩淲","text":"向来愁见客，今去莫吟诗。\n自是才情减，何劳朋旧为。\n一身元属我，百事总因谁。\n溪路多虾菜，呼童问早炊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25882,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晓冷","author":"韩淲","text":"晓雾知犹冷，初阳觉更和。\n午风吹不断，夜气暑还多。\n帘槛翻黄蝶，灯窗扑白蛾。\n晚春初夏际，蚕麦复如何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25883,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"风落","author":"韩淲","text":"风落摇窗牖，烟垂暗屋檐。\n漫空时衮衮，洒迥复纤纤。\n著柳真堪折，迷花自可粘。\n春前一尺雪，农事不须占。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25884,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"明月","author":"韩淲","text":"明月度窗棂，荷香逼酒醒。\n水声鸣涧壑，风影散林坰。\n暑雨收微眇，晴云动杳冥。\n小轩清坐久，高下数飞萤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25885,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜月","author":"韩淲","text":"月近中秋好，人宁不用情。\n那知云欲暮，遽作雨连明。\n圆缺閒皆见，阴晴老自惊。\n夜凉山叶响，灯火短长檠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25886,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻雨凉意可掬","author":"韩淲","text":"秋声连夜起，雨过雨来时。\n睡觉风生屋，凉知水到池。\n交游稀自好，出入懒方宜。\n只被章泉误，书题又寄诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25887,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚雨可爱","author":"韩淲","text":"灯火凉秋夜，空山雨到檐。\n吹声初甚少，落势近频添。\n篱菊丛丛润，畦蔬种种沾。\n沈思仍静听，香鼎伴书签。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25888,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"初三日急雨湖山云气初霁楼居佳甚","author":"韩淲","text":"雨后见云山，家林恨未还。\n人生何自苦，身老定谁閒。\n溶泄平输处，纵横罗列间。\n幽幽清润气，楼迥自怡颜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25889,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜坐闻雨 其一","author":"韩淲","text":"夜静时闻雨，山深远听更。\n疏林声转永，孤戍景何清。\n方册舒还卷，残缸暗复明。\n脱巾搔首坐，曳履欠身行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25890,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜坐闻雨 其二","author":"韩淲","text":"寒夜空山雨，声从远树来。\n老怀浑木塞，痴坐只灰堆。\n抖擞閒题句，团栾试把杯。\n峥嵘岁云暮，春在腊前梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25891,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨处","author":"韩淲","text":"雨处茫茫白，晴边隐隐青。\n林间田舍屋，水际酒家亭。\n野迥惊初见，村深惜未经。\n阴沉思得月，历落喜瞻星。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25892,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"烟雨","author":"韩淲","text":"汀洲生玉水，烟雨对灵山。\n翠碧迷千嶂，清泠泻一湾。\n寻春因共载，落日不知还。\n便是名人画，无能写此閒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25893,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"煖雨","author":"韩淲","text":"土煖鸣嘘蚓，山昏聚宿鸦。\n沿流多佛屋，隔县少诗家。\n怕醉休温酒，狂吟待饮茶。\n花天晴自喜，麦地雨谁家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25894,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨中 其一","author":"韩淲","text":"幽林远朝市，太息古来今。\n四月麦秋后，江南梅雨临。\n庭前三径在，路口一溪深。\n车马有时到，定多閒淡心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25895,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨中 其二","author":"韩淲","text":"花浥垂垂细，林摇点点稀。\n绿繁枝困袅，红淡蕊鲜肥。\n高下海棠起，浅深山柳围。\n云梳烟未止，风急雨争飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25896,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨中 其三","author":"韩淲","text":"雨叶凄凄晚，风花肃肃春。\n乍看浑入意，久坐恐伤神。\n城郭三家市，山林一病身。\n幽偏无客到，疏懒寄吾真。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25897,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨后","author":"韩淲","text":"鱼沼成吹沫，蛛檐落断丝。\n盆花半开合，阶草尽离披。\n风静凉犹在，云低晓更迟。\n懒能寻枕簟，好去把锄犁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25898,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"二十二日雨 其一","author":"韩淲","text":"整衾和枕簟，振席见灯檠。\n欲读书休读，难成梦也成。\n四山连屋静，一叶隔窗鸣。\n总不关吾事，无非是物情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25899,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"二十二日雨 其二","author":"韩淲","text":"涧水应添润，山云定不虚。\n夜光离复合，朝气惨而舒。\n履亩禾须穫，窥园菜可锄。\n稀疏遍篱落，微密上阶除。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25900,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"四月二十三日渴雨","author":"韩淲","text":"雾下疑成雨，檐低暗复明。\n田家思一稔，王国虑多晴。\n天岂预人事，世应容我耕。\n凭轩归计定，只得待雷声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25901,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丁寺丞灵山阁同国正小集是日得雨次韵仁甫五字","author":"韩淲","text":"野寺乘凉雨，宜从志喜论。\n桥分一水隔，城列万家屯。\n乐寓东山妓，贤归北海樽。\n年登农满望，客醉我忘言。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25902,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"五六日大雨","author":"韩淲","text":"海角地蒸雨，江南天要梅。\n晚春知望久，中夏得愁开。\n郁郁阴阴过，绵绵浩浩来。\n已传增米价，只道损苗栽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25903,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夏雨","author":"韩淲","text":"转输三伏雨，探借九秋风。\n沾洒莲犹碧，飘摇叶未红。\n荒凉甘退缩，清润拟从容。\n在野农人喜，仍年禾黍丰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25904,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东流值雨","author":"韩淲","text":"客恨何时了，萧萧雨未晴。\n异乡无伴处，荒县少人行。\n树色巡檐碧，江声绕枕清。\n且凭閒景物，陶写小诗成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25905,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪后微雨","author":"韩淲","text":"烟重雨尤寒，风销日未乾。\n江湖浮绿净，岩岫列青攒。\n懒出空穿履，宜归且钓竿。\n凄凉两都旧，洛下卧袁安。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25906,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"苦雨","author":"韩淲","text":"开岁晴非少，经旬雨是多。\n涧寒人迹断，山暖鸟声和。\n试手应如画，回身易掷梭。\n无聊宜已矣，有兴竟云何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25907,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"五月八日喜雨","author":"韩淲","text":"洒洒如人意，明明助岁功。\n夜阑愁有月，晓起喜无风。\n坡老记为美，宣王诗最工。\n朝家一祈祷，田里得和丰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25908,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十一日同处晦苍筤喜雨","author":"韩淲","text":"清坐看凉雨，山林静有声。\n交游因共话，衰老欲何营。\n风急初疑敛，云低又苦倾。\n爽然神观定，篱径不知尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25909,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"凉雨 其一","author":"韩淲","text":"默坐看凉雨，山林有正声。\n冥濛元广大，点滴半虚明。\n云叶才群起，风枝又一倾。\n信知尘易遣，徒乱雅难平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":25910,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}}]